titutions and rising tension. Timothy Castagne and Calvin Bassey were booked as they struggled to contain counter-attacks. In stoppage time, Fulham launched a desperate offensive, with Rodrigo Muniz and Gonzalo Garcia both seeing late efforts denied by the Chelsea defense and goalkeeper Robert Sanchez . Despite holding 61% of the possession, the hosts could not find a late equalizer, falling to a clinical Chelsea side."
